Adapted into geometry.ts: radial polygon/circle profiles, Catmull-Rom contour,
head/eye tangent projection and smooth gaze noise.
Adapted into catalog.ts: eight shape recipes, twelve palette colors and
sixteen facial expression poses. Protocol IDs are owned by relay-protocol.
core.ts uses task-controlled animation and frozen composite transitions;
no upstream player, timeline, exporter, animation profile or UI was copied.

